(Bytes)
```

During implementation,

we discussed whether displaying raw bytes was useful for day-to-day monitoring.

The decision was made to replace the byte-based gauge with a percentage-based gauge because percentages provide a much clearer operational view.

The byte-based metric was retained for a historical Time Series panel later in the dashboard.

This approach allows engineers to:

- Quickly assess current heap health using the gauge.
- Analyze heap growth over time using the graph.

